### Create a new teacher
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teachers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "subject": "Mathematics",
  "schoolId": 1
}

### Get all teachers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teachers

### Get a teacher by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teachers/1

### Update a teacher
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/teachers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "subject": "Physics",
  "schoolId": 1
}

### Delete a teacher
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/teachers/2